---
description: Vitest and Testing Library conventions
globs: "**/*.test.ts,**/*.test.tsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Runner: Vitest (`npm run test` / `npm run test:run`).
- Components: `@testing-library/react` + jsdom; assert roles/labels/clicks, not full MUI trees.
- Avoid large page snapshots; unit-test pure logic in `src/utils.ts` first.
- Mock `next/router` via `src/test/mocks/next-router.ts` when testing pages.
- Review snapshot diffs intentionally — do not bulk-update without cause.
